/* Xenon VMX128 forms of legacy AltiVec/Cell instructions.
   Generated by tools/gen_xenon_retarget.py from isa/xenon_isa.json
   (legacy_mirror, tied_operands, semantics) and
   isa/findings_instructions.csv; do not edit by hand.

   XENON_VMX128_FORM (LEGACY, VMX128, KIND)
     DIRECT      same operands in the same order: the output helper
                 xenon_vmx128_output renames LEGACY to VMX128 when an
                 operand is v32-v127 (Rc forms keep their ".").
     TIED        VMX128 reads its destination as a source; the
                 patterns spell the 128 template and the "0" tie out.
     RESTRICTED  an operand is limited (vperm128 control: v0-v7, wU).
   Illegal 128 forms (lvsl128, lvsr128) are not listed, nor the
   estimates kept legacy-only (vrefp128, vrsqrtefp128, vexptefp128,
   vlogefp128: equivalence not established, UNVERIFIED_128).  */

